          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini amma seera baasa, aka nami lafa anini fidu keesa jiru ch'ufti Waaqa Danieli sodaate saalfatufi. Inni Waaqa jiru, ka haga jiru jireenna tau. Finna isaa dandaani imballeesani jabeenni isaaleeni muumme inqabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni nama baase badile d'owa, lafafi gubba irati akheekha jabaafi waan mama tolcha. Nami afaani nyeench'a keesaa Danieli baase isuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba akasiini Danieli bara Dariofi Koreshini, ka gosa Ajemi, lafa mohate bulti dansa, argate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.6.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
